message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "CircuitAgent — AI Hardware Synthesis (Community Edition)"
abstract: >-
  The open community layer of CircuitAgent: a hardware DSL built on pre-verified
  circuit blocks, a key-free live LCSC parts client, netlist and CPL data contracts,
  an industrial DFX audit engine implementing IPC-2152 and IPC-2221 rules, EDA and
  manufacturing exporters for KiCad and JLCPCB, closed-form parametric design
  solvers, and a standards-compliant stdio MCP server.
